            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I must admit that I accidentally added too much pudding to this recipe however this is insanely good. I really don't remember how much pudding I added to the whipped topping but when I make this again I will update the amount of pudding I used. My 14 year old grandson tasted it and thought it was ice cream giving it 5 stars. I only gave it 4 stars due to me altering the recipes.",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-16T11:06:46.710Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jaay"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'd done something similar to this recipe as a mousse before. I prepared 1 package of instant pudding using about a half cup less milk than the package calls for, then folded in a container of thawed whipped topping. After that I stored in the refrigerator, not the freezer. It made a good and fairly healthy snack.",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-16T11:06:32.383Z"
          },
